---
description: On-page SEO requirements for StitchCalc pages
globs: src/pages/**/*.astro
---
- Unique title (~50–60 chars) with primary keyword near the start; meta description ~150 chars.
- Exactly one H1; logical H2/H3; self-canonical; trailing slash URLs.
- Answer-first intro; tool above the fold on tool pages.
- No keyword cannibalization — check docs/KEYWORD-MAP.md.
